{"path":"thread/shared_lock/~shared_lock","title":"std::shared_lock<Mutex>::~shared_lock","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_lock&lt;Mutex&gt;::</span>~shared_lock","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/~shared_lock","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"If *this has an associated mutex ((mutex() returns a non-null pointer) and has acquired ownership of it (owns() returns true), the mutex is unlocked by calling unlock_shared().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx14\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">~shared_lock<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destroys the lock.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> has an associated mutex ((<span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/mutex\">mutex()</a></span> returns a non-null pointer) and has acquired ownership of it (<span class=\"t-lc\">owns()</span> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>), the mutex is unlocked by calling <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_mutex/unlock_shared\">unlock_shared()</a></span>.\n</p>","headings":[],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/shared_lock","title":"std::shared_lock"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_lock<Mutex>::~shared_lock","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++14. Destroys the lock."}]},"standards":["C++14"],"wordCount":33,"codeBlockCount":0}
